evmone
------------------------------------------
evmone is a C++ implementation of the Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM). Created
by members of the Ewasm team, the project aims for clean, standalone EVM
implementation that can be imported as an execution module by Ethereum Client
projects. The codebase of evmone is optimized to provide fast and efficient
execution of EVM smart contracts.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbenchmark1-1.10.0-1bl1
  libevmone-devel-0.25.0-1bl1
  libevmone0.25-0.25.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cli11-2.7.2-1bl1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  intx-0.15.0-1bl1
  libbenchmark-devel-1.10.0-1bl1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
