Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ipsilon/evmone

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ipsilon/evmone/archive/refs/tags/v0.25.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack evmone-0.25.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./evmone-0.25.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/evmone-0.25.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/evmone-0.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevmone0.25-0.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libevmone-devel-0.25.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(evmone)
  /usr/bin/evmone-bench.exe
  /usr/bin/evmone.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/evmone.README
